  "contracts": [
    "FullLoopResult::plc_messages() supplies exact CRC-validated packets, source/descriptor identity, typed meanings, byte offsets, pending/issue state and actual sample-based transmission coverage.",
    "Qt formats public fields only; no frame/MAC/descriptor/modulation/CP/RP decoding, checksum, completion-clock or scientific numeric algorithm remains in these two files.",
    "The existing 32-packet display policy, exact byte rows, scalar JSON field names and known labels/children remain. NCP wire alias and data-profile admission remain separate domains.",
    "Zero loading retains the existing raw-only tree state, distinct from QPSK and independent of backend recognition.",
    "Missing/invalid later observations keep earlier validated packets according to the public owner; absence is never filled with fabricated bytes."
  ],
